{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d2f768d0-2485-8a0d-8805-cbf1d552a07c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:29:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I want to report a problem with a crosswalk. The paint is faded, almost gone, and the cars they do not stop. No way they see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:26:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. Where is the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:26:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 383 Pelham Street, on the Hill. Right there in front, where people cross to the other side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eighty-three Pelham. Got it. Is it a busy spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is on a bus route, so you have the bus stopping and people getting off and then they cross. And the cars just go, go, go. Nobody slows down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good to know, the bus route makes a difference. Let me put that in the notes. And can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yesenia Mejia. Y-E-S-E-N-I-A, Mejia, M-E-J-I-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Mejia. And a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five oh. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get a reference number for this? So I can say it if I call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, absolutely. Grab a pen, I'll give it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, one second. Let me find a pen. [pause] This one does not work. No way. Let me try another one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:27:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The second one also nothing. It is dry. Okay, the third one, it is a marker, no, it is too thick for this little paper. Wait, I have one more here in the drawer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens every time, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes! Okay, the fourth one works. I am ready. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the reference number is PW, dash, one two four seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, one two four seven. Let me read it back. P as in Paulo, W, one, two, four, seven. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. I've logged it as a faded crosswalk at 383 Pelham Street, bus route, drivers not yielding. It goes to the crew that handles striping and signs, and they'll look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you know when they come? Is it soon, or later in the spring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a date. Paint work usually depends on the weather, and this time of year it's tough to get it to stick. But it's in the system and they'll see the note about the bus stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand. The cold, yes, the paint does not dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. If you call back, just give them that reference number and they can pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you very much for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Mejia. Have a good rest of your day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
